<%# The trail above a company or plant page (#708): Nuclear Directory › category. The page's own name is the heading right
    below, so it isn't repeated (#700); the structured data keeps the full trail. A trail of one (a company with no category)
    says nothing next to the wordmark, so there is no nav. One line, never wrapping: the category shortens (full text in
    title) before anything wraps. Locals: trail (DirectoryHelper#page_trail). %>
<% crumbs = trail[0...-1] %>
<% if crumbs.size > 1 %>
  <nav class="nd-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <ol>
      <% crumbs.each do |label, path| %>
        <li><%= link_to label, path, class: "nd-link nd-link--muted", title: label %></li>
      <% end %>
    </ol>
  </nav>
<% end %>
